  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cianjur Post-Earthquake Relief Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">November 2022 - a magnitude 5.6 earthquake devastated Cianjur, Indonesia. At least 602 deceased and tens of thousands injured, while hundreds of thousands displaced. It has been more than five months but their lives have still not recovered. The majority of them lost their source of income. Children are missing school. ASAR Humanity is working with stakeholder pushing through post-disaster programs. Building shelters, WASH facilities, temporary schools, and providing people empowerment programs.</narrative>
  </description>
